../../**
# All sibling workspace packages — the bundled engine is copied into
# engine/ (no ../) inside this package via build:copy-engine, and any
# other sibling (including future packages like midi-engine) is not part of
# the .vsix. .vscodeignore patterns match the literal
# relative path string vsce emits, so the previous `../engine/**`
# entry was per-package by accident — generalizing it to `../*/**`
# avoids needing a new exception every time a sibling package is added.
../*/**
engine/package-lock.json
engine/package.json
# Keep the built engine and runtime dependencies
!engine/dist/**
!engine/node_modules/**
# Keep bundled native audio daemon binary (Issue #306, darwin-arm64 only —
# rust is the shipped backend since cutover #369)
!engine/bin/**
